WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:00.968
Hello.

00:00:00.968 --> 00:00:05.259
This short video shows where everything in the Çekicin AI project is.

00:00:05.259 --> 00:00:07.221
Now it is all on one start page.

00:00:07.221 --> 00:00:12.616
The links are grouped into six sections, and each section has its own number and colour.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:14.999
Section one is customer demos.

00:00:14.999 --> 00:00:20.606
Send a photo of the car to the Telegram assistant and see the damage and the estimated repair cost.

00:00:20.606 --> 00:00:26.667
You can try the same on the website with the photo test, the spare-part photos and the part price database.

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:29.988
Section two is AI modules and tests:

00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:34.380
each of the six modules, its measured accuracy and its demo.

00:00:34.453 --> 00:00:36.283
Section three is reports:

00:00:36.283 --> 00:00:41.627
the roadmap status report in Turkish and English, as a PDF and a video.

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:43.944
Section four is partnership:

00:00:43.944 --> 00:00:48.179
the research and co-development programme, with its PDF and video.

00:00:48.241 --> 00:00:50.234
Section five is the admin panel.

00:00:50.234 --> 00:00:51.293
It needs a login;

00:00:51.293 --> 00:00:54.905
the username and password are in the message you received.

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:59.578
Section six has the website, the backup address and technical links.

00:00:59.578 --> 00:01:03.806
The start page link and a PDF of this information are in the message.

00:01:03.806 --> 00:01:04.401
Thank you.
